From: Ke Du <kedu@codeaurora.org>
Date: Thu, 25 Mar 2021 17:13:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] turtlebot3-node: set initial value on robot pose

Resolve controller server memory issue

Signed-off-by: Ke Du <kedu@codeaurora.org>
---
 src/odometry.cpp | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/odometry.cpp b/src/odometry.cpp
index 378e854..46bee61 100644
--- a/src/odometry.cpp
+++ b/src/odometry.cpp
@@ -32,7 +32,8 @@ Odometry::Odometry(
   wheels_radius_(wheels_radius),
   use_imu_(false),
   publish_tf_(false),
-  imu_angle_(0.0f)
+  imu_angle_(0.0f),
+  robot_pose_({})
 {
   RCLCPP_INFO(nh_->get_logger(), "Init Odometry");
 
